{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00734",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.77,
      "end_seconds": 12.38,
      "duration_seconds": 11.61,
      "text": "Hi Mr Brady, I'm Aoife, I'll do your measurements before you see the doctor. Hop on the scales. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.66,
      "end_seconds": 26.79,
      "duration_seconds": 12.13,
      "text": "Sure. I've lost a bit of weight, actually. Or gained. I can't remember. Do you want my shoes off? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 49.49,
      "end_seconds": 58.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "text": "Please. Blood pressure 128 over 80, pulse 72, temperature 36.6, weight 92 kilos, height 180 centimetres, BMI 28.4."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.94,
      "end_seconds": 65.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "Come in, Mr Brady. What's been going on? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.66,
      "end_seconds": 79.45,
      "duration_seconds": 12.79,
      "text": "I'm tired all the time, doc, and my drive's gone, if you know what I mean. Down below. For about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.55,
      "end_seconds": 88.24,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "A lower sex drive, and tiredness. Any trouble with erections?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.59,
      "end_seconds": 102.68,
      "duration_seconds": 12.09,
      "text": "Sometimes. Not always. It's more that I don't care, if I'm honest. And I've got no energy for the gym."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.7,
      "end_seconds": 109.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "Any other symptoms, hot flushes, low mood, reduced shaving?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.4,
      "end_seconds": 116.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "No hot flushes. Mood's okay, maybe a bit grumpy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.4,
      "end_seconds": 123.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "And do you have any other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.2,
      "end_seconds": 131.47,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "Type 2 diabetes, and sleep apnoea, I use a machine at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.03,
      "end_seconds": 138.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Any family history of diabetes or similar?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.16,
      "end_seconds": 144.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "My dad had diabetes, yes. And his dad."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.35,
      "end_seconds": 148.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Let me examine you. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.05,
      "end_seconds": 169.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.97,
      "end_seconds": 182.75,
      "duration_seconds": 10.78,
      "text": "Your chest and heart sound normal, and there's no breast enlargement. Your testicles are normal in size and firm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.67,
      "end_seconds": 186.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Is that good? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.9,
      "end_seconds": 192.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "It's reassuring. Any cough, wheeze or breathing trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.09,
      "end_seconds": 198.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "No, nothing. The machine helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.06,
      "end_seconds": 218.17,
      "duration_seconds": 19.11,
      "text": "What you describe could be low testosterone, but with diabetes and sleep apnoea, tiredness and low drive can have other causes. I'd say low testosterone is possible, and we need to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.99,
      "end_seconds": 223.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "How do you check? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.23,
      "end_seconds": 236.12,
      "duration_seconds": 10.89,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a morning blood test for testosterone, and some other hormones, taken before 10 am, on two separate days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 239.11,
      "end_seconds": 246.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.64,
      "text": "I can book the first for tomorrow at eight, Mr Brady. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.66,
      "end_seconds": 255.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "And I'd like a blood sugar and thyroid test at the same time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.83,
      "end_seconds": 263.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "Right. If it's low, can you fix it? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.13,
      "end_seconds": 276.59,
      "duration_seconds": 11.46,
      "text": "If it's low, we'll find out why first, and then there are treatments. I'm not prescribing anything today. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.62,
      "end_seconds": 280.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Fair enough. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.91,
      "end_seconds": 293.4,
      "duration_seconds": 11.49,
      "text": "In the meantime, sleep seven hours, use your machine every night, and walk daily. These all raise your energy and hormones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.7,
      "end_seconds": 297.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "I'll try. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.42,
      "end_seconds": 305.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.7,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in three weeks, with the results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.91,
      "end_seconds": 310.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Three weeks. See you then. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 312.14,
      "end_seconds": 316.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "See you tomorrow morning, Mr Brady. ~"
    }
  ]
}
